@host = http://localhost:5066

### 1) API alive?
GET {{host}}/api/health

### 2) Connect to SQL Server + read all 41 tables
GET {{host}}/api/health/database

### 3) Companies (seed data: Advanced Technology LLC)
GET {{host}}/api/companies

### 4) One company
GET {{host}}/api/companies/1

### 5) Departments of company 1 (seed: Finance, Procurement)
GET {{host}}/api/companies/1/departments

### 6) Create a company (write test)
POST {{host}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Test Company",
  "currencyCode": "EGP",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "country": "Egypt"
}
